The binary files in this directory are firmware dumps of the Apogee BK-01.

monitor.rom is a dump of the Monitor, the base operating system of the
Apogee BK-01, and is copyright (c) its respective rights holders.
chargen.rom is a dump of the character generator ROM and is copyright (c)
its respective rights holders.

romdisk.rom is a dump of an external ROM disk image and is copyright (c)
the rights holders of the ROM disk software and the respective rights
holders of the individual programs it contains, including any third-party
assets embedded therein.
